id: E098
title: libolm 项目已于 2024-07-31 官方弃用
category: software_status
severity: info
trigger:
  - Status: libolm was officially deprecated on 2024-07-31
context: olm 加密库（Matrix 协议 E2EE）编译
platform: all
solution:
  - 源码从 GitLab 获取: https://gitlab.matrix.org/matrix-org/olm
  - GitHub 仅为归档说明，无实际源码
  - PyPI python-olm 包含 libolm 子目录源码
note: |
  libolm 已弃用，建议考虑替代方案如 vodozemac (Rust 实现)
  如需编译历史版本，可从 PyPI python-olm 获取源码
